<title>HUNGARY: Hungary c.bank cuts o/n, 1-wk repo rates by 25 bps.</title>
<headline>Hungary c.bank cuts o/n, 1-wk repo rates by 25 bps.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's central bank said on Monday it reduced its overnight repo rate and one-week repo rate facilities both by 25 basis points to 26 percent each.</p>
</text>
